            "review_text": "cezza77\nPakenham, Australia78 contributions\n0\nAmazing!\nApr 2025 • Couples\nHubby & I enjoyed an amazing meal at Tram Ham tonight. The food was delicious, the service terrific & the ambience lovely. We had a beef skewer, a pork belly skewer, large plate of minced beef with cheese & small plate of roast duck breast - all were presented amazingly, cooked to perfection & served with a complimentary salad & sauces. They have awesome cocktails on the menu & equally awesome mocktails that we indulged in. We paid around 1million VND (AUD$70) & thought it was great value for money. Highly recommend!!\nRead more\nWritten April 29, 2025",
