            "review_title": "Review at Trạm Hầm Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Lukas S\n12 contributions\n0\nA banger experience! 5/5 food & venue\nDec 2024 • Couples\nHad a dinner here with my fiance during christmas. \n\nThis was a banger! Had the combo menu with a smoked duck salad, skewers with lemongrass venison, chicken and five spice pork belly, and some grilled corn on the cob.\n\nIt is not a ”traditional vietnamese” experience (at least for a european), but the food was top class, had nice composition, and vibey venue. Open kitchen and rustic feel made the experience great.\n\n+:\nReasonably priced\nVenue\nTasty craft beer\n5 spice pork belly (11/10 ⭐️)\n\n-:\nLack of menu recommendation makes me afraid i missed some of the golden dishes.\n\nWould gladly go back many times!\nRead more\nWritten December 26, 2024",
