            "review_text": "Sarah\nThailand55 contributions\n0\nHO CHI MINH CITY - VIET NAM TOURISM\nDec 2024 • Friends\nThe restaurant is located in an alley, the space is spacious and the decoration is very romantic, suitable for couples. Regarding food, I like the grilled skewers, and the ice cream dish called grilled lam rice, eaten with sesame salt, is very delicious. You should go in the evening to enjoy the restaurant's atmosphere.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 15, 2024",
